WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.000
SCP-682 Vs Godzilla: Who would take home the
gold in the battle of these mighty reptiles?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.560
Godzilla, obviously, has the advantage in
terms of his offensive capabilities: He’s

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.680
considerably larger than SCP-682, and has
the incredible power of his atomic breath

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.800
- Capable of taking down other huge monsters
like King Ghidorah or the MUTOs.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.760
However, SCP-682 has its trump card: Insane
adaptability.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.840
When faced with Godzilla, it may adapt to
imitate the monster’s atomic breath, or

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.040
begin to grow to epic proportions to match
it in size.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.200
In the end, it’s hard to know who would
win, but a true stalemate seems incredibly

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:37.680
likely.

